            "review_title": "Review at Lotus restaurant",
            "review_text": "Safari21411542162\n3 contributions\n0\nThe restaurant offers a spacious setting with breathtaking views of majestic nature\nJul 2025 • Family\nThe restaurant offers a spacious setting with breathtaking views of majestic nature, creating a relaxing and impressive atmosphere from the very first moment. It is truly an ideal destination for those who want to enjoy delicious cuisine while immersing themselves in a serene environment.\nThe dishes are carefully prepared, flavorful, and beautifully presented. The drinks are also a highlight – skillfully crafted with a perfect balance of taste and creativity, adding to the overall dining experience.\nDuring our visit, the restaurant was quite busy, and we had to wait around 20 minutes for a table. However, the manager personally came to apologize, which showed professionalism and attentiveness. This thoughtful gesture made the experience even more pleasant and memorable.\nOverall, this is a restaurant with excellent food quality, a friendly and dedicated staff, and a stunning atmosphere. Definitely worth returning to and recommending to friends and family.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 14, 2025",
