            "review_text": "wang2383\nLongjing, Taichung73128 contributions\n0\nEnjoy a delicious dinner while enjoying the magnificent views of the West Bank Mountains\nJul 2025 • Couples\nLocated on the top floor of Hotel DE Sapha, Vietnam, the LOTUS RESTAURANT is home to the luxurious LOTUS RESTAURANT & BAR, a luxurious contemporary setting and wooden decoration. The restaurant and bar area is in a classic style, reminiscent of Indochina. Black, white, cream and blue gray shades are accentuated by geometric pattern furniture and square pattern tiles. The menu offers genuine delicious Vietnamese cuisine, each dish is creative and suits my taste, this is the first meal we ate in the sandwich.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten July 27, 2025",
